      "quest_id": "high_sanctuary_infiltration",
      "quest_title": "The High Sanctuary",
      "quest_kind": "main",
      "summary": "Swallow the spirit pill and defeat Seer Valerius in the Reanimation Sanctum.",
      "beat_note": "Orva gave Layla the spirit pill. Swallow it to gain spiritual sight, revealing Seer Valerius as the lone living human among the captive spirits. Defeat him to break the ritual and claim the Bind Scroll.",
      "update_message": "Swallow the spirit pill and defeat Seer Valerius.",
      "narrative_lines": [
        "Orva clutches the silver arrow pin to her chest, her eyes wide with relief. 'Einar... he lives! Take this spirit pill. Swallow it before you face Seer Valerius. Without it, you will only see empty air, but with it, you will see the captive spirits and the Seer directing them. Stop him!'"
